    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Understanding <strong>capital gains tax, dividend tax exemptions, zero inheritance tax status, and real estate transaction taxes in Indonesia</strong> is vital for investors, property owners, and business founders. Navigating the regulatory landscape established by the <a href="https://www.pajak.go.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline">Direktorat Jenderal Pajak (DJP)</a> can feel incredibly overwhelming, especially when the sheer volume of bureaucratic jargon stands between you and your wealth preservation goals.
    </p>
    
