      Whether you are an expatriate retiring in Bali, a foreign investor setting up a PT PMA (foreign-owned company) in Jakarta, or a local entrepreneur planning your legacy, getting the tax right isn't just about compliance—it's about the psychological weight of knowing your assets are protected. In this comprehensive guide, we dissect the nuances of Indonesian tax law for 2026 to help you move from reactive compliance to proactive strategy, empowering you to make informed decisions that safeguard your financial future.
    </p>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-6 dark:border-overlay-light dark:bg-surface shadow-sm">
